# W4 (OAuth): dev-only OAuth client IDs/secrets for Google/Notion/GitHub MCP
# connections. Real credentials — NEVER committed. Ship path seals these in the
# OS keyring via Settings → Connections; this file is a dev-testing convenience
# read by src-tauri at startup. See docs/OAUTH_SETUP_RUNBOOK.md.
src-tauri/oauth.dev.json

# CORE-C1.1 (D-C1-1): the bundled citrate-node sidecar binary is large and is
# NOT committed. Tauri's externalBin resolves `binaries/citrate-<target-triple>`
# at bundle time; per-platform CI cross-build of these is an S7 item. Keep the
# directory's README, ignore the binaries.
src-tauri/binaries/*
!src-tauri/binaries/README.md
